WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.465
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.465 --> 00:00:02.840
DEVON RODRIGUEZ:
Excuse me, miss.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.708
I drew you.

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:04.708
This is fire!

00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:05.333
Yo!
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.360
I'm Devon Rodriguez, and I'm
the most followed visual artist

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:08.960
on TikTok.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.345
Today, I have over 25 million
followers and counting.

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:12.180
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.650
[HISSING]

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.230
And in the next
30 days, I'm going

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.605
to teach you techniques that
will give you the confidence

00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:18.958
to paint anything in the world.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:21.500
So in this class, I'm going to
teach you my secret techniques

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.510
that I've never
taught anyone before.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.070
I like to smash the bristles.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.990
It makes the edges super soft.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.838
And I'm going to break down
my process step by step.

00:00:29.838 --> 00:00:31.880
I'm going to be teaching
you about materials, how

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.190
to apply the colors,
mix the colors, how

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.340
to blend your tones together,
how to draw proportion,

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.590
understanding light, the
importance of reference

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:40.250
photos--

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.290
everything you need to know
to paint the portrait.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.207
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:45.207 --> 00:00:47.540
I'll teach you how to level
up your drawing and painting

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.660
skills, even if you're
just starting out.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.410
So by the time we're
done with this class,

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.665
you're going to have your
own 9 by 12 oil painting.

00:00:53.665 --> 00:00:55.040
We're going to
have a lot of fun.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:55.640
[LAUGHS]

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.690
[MUSIC PLAYING]

